  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the advent of OSC for avatars and, soon, worlds, I would like to suggest the usage/integration of libsodium for cryptographic security.\nDetails of libsodium can be found here: https://doc.libsodium.org/\nSince OSC seems to be inherently unsecure (in that anyone can listen in on the communication) it would be wise to have a way for OSC app creators to ensure that specific communications (in regards to things like passwords) to be secure in transit.  Thus allowing the usage of libsodium within worlds via Udon would make cryptographic usage viable.",
